21:12.790 --> 21:16.290
Tokyo

21:12.790 --> 21:16.290
Kyoto

21:12.790 --> 21:16.290
30th Annual Exchange Event

21:12.790 --> 21:16.290
Winner: Tokyo

21:20.200 --> 21:24.080
Yaga, do something about Gojo first.

22:54.930 --> 22:57.430
Juju Stroll

22:56.800 --> 22:57.430
Salmon.

22:57.430 --> 22:59.060
Q: Rice or bread?

22:59.060 --> 23:00.720
Rice?

22:59.060 --> 23:07.030
Q: Are you a rice person or a bread person?

23:00.720 --> 23:04.560
No, I like bread, too...

23:04.560 --> 23:07.030
Wait, is it served with roe?

23:07.030 --> 23:08.650
Q: Are you a rice person or a bread person?

23:07.030 --> 23:08.650
Rice.

23:08.650 --> 23:10.190
Rice, I think?

23:08.650 --> 23:12.660
Q: Are you a rice person or a bread person?

23:10.190 --> 23:12.660
What? I definitely prefer bread.

23:12.660 --> 23:14.490
Q: Are you a rice person or a bread person?

23:13.110 --> 23:14.490
Salted rice ball.

23:14.490 --> 23:17.830
Obviously bread, because I'm a panda!

23:14.490 --> 23:19.870
Q: Are you a rice person or a bread person?

23:17.830 --> 23:19.870
You want me to kill you?!

23:20.790 --> 23:23.250
This one's...

23:23.250 --> 23:26.480
kind of forced...

23:26.480 --> 23:28.740
They're out of ideas.

23:28.740 --> 23:29.890
We're going home.

23:36.470 --> 23:39.930
Episode 22:
The Origin of Blind Obedience
